  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Adds strict transactional producers for field3-full-owner-authority-v1 and field3-live-class-suffix-owner-v1. The first reruns the complete frozen resident authority and all 301 exact principal relations. The second independently regenerates the relation and full15 owners from authenticated raw/protocol inputs, replays terminal B, derives selection without fixtures, recomputes antiuniformizer tau, and proves the generated ideals, Smith order, and principal factors by exact ideal arithmetic.",
    "risks": [
      "The focused class qualification uses a sparse synthetic 153088-bit raw-log owner and authentic exact HNF protocol; every full15 cell is replayed, but it is not the authentic production raw-log owner.",
      "Exact order principality is retained as the complete factored alpha column plus all 301 independently proved principal-relation equations and R*T=H; directly expanding alpha in the quartic algebra is intentionally avoided because authentic transform exponents reach 34 bits and naive expansion did not finish within a bounded 15-second probe.",
      "The integration base differs from origin/main by 1287 files, so pnpm test:changed would select the repository-wide build/compiler/integration/docs suite. The requested bounded lane instead ran pnpm build, pnpm architecture:check, the exact focused checker, and targeted Pyright."
    ],
    "next_steps": [
      "Merge this commit into the integration spine and make field3_terminal_owner_adapters.cjs admit only these exact replayed schemas.",
      "After authentic raw/full15 publication, run the documented relation and class commands once under the campaign resource guard, then feed their immutable digests to the live-final adapter.",
      "Keep the unit relationOwnerSha256 crosslink and C7 torsion semantic validation in the terminal adapter/C7 hardening lane."
    ]
  }
